"description":"Help keep your family safe and connected on the go with Verizon Family. With features such as Location sharing, Parental Controls, Safe Walk with SOS, Crash Detection, Roadside Assistance, and Family Line all in one app.\n\nFrom a single app, you can:\n- Use content filtering\n- Monitor and limit Verizon call and text activity on smartphones\n- Limit Verizon data usage on smartphones or connected tablets\n- Monitor web and app activity\n- Manage screen time\n- Pause internet\n- Use location sharing, pick-me-up and check-in features\n- Get location alerts\n- View driving activity\n\nBasic location sharing and 24/7 Assist are now available on your Smartwatch via Watch OS. Location services such as Safe Walk are not available at this time.\n\nLegal: To use the Verizon Family app, a Verizon standard monthly postpaid account on an eligible device or an invitation from a Verizon account is required. Verizon postpaid mobile plans include Verizon Family location sharing features at no add’l cost or upgrade to Verizon Family Plus ($14.99/mo until canceled) for location sharing and alerts, parental controls for calls, texts and online activity, driving insights and roadside assistance. Roadside assistance through Signature Motor Club, 4 events/yr. Verizon Family app download required. Service does not monitor calls or texts sent over the internet and does not contact 911 for crash or SOS alerts. Push notifications must be enabled to see when new members join family acct. Some alerts sent via text message. Msg & data rates apply.\n\nSee full terms and conditions at: https://www.verizon.com/support/verizon-family-legal/", "sellerUrl":"https://vzw.com/smartfamily/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"390317056", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":38805, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.30937999999999998834709913353435695171356201171875, "userRatingCount":38805}, 
